Asynchronous replication:
  t=7: read from F2 sees 2 of 4 orders (replication lag)
  leader crashed at t=12; promoted F1 with 5 of 6 acknowledged orders
  acknowledged but LOST: ['order@10']

Semi-synchronous (leader waits for F1 before acknowledging):
  leader crashed at t=12; promoted F1 with 6 of 6 acknowledged orders
  acknowledged but LOST: none

Quorum reads/writes with N = 3 replicas:
  W=1 R=1: may read stale data
  W=2 R=1: may read stale data
  W=2 R=2: always reads the latest write
  W=3 R=1: always reads the latest write
